differ.py is a Python port of code from Phabricator, Arcanist and libphutil, script.js follows some
of the same code in JavaScript, and style.css is made from Phabricator's stylesheets. They were
changed from the originals: translated from PHP, cut down to the diff view, and adapted to work
without a server.

